      "description": "Mark a function that returns data about people (names, email, phone, address, bank account, salary, health). Tailr Core then lets only the fields in sensitivity pass, gives the AI pseudonyms, works one person at a time (lookup required, at most maxRecords), applies a daily limit per user, never caches it, and logs every lookup. The connector sets the minimum: an administrator can only make it stricter. See docs/koppelingen-maken.md, \"Privacygevoelige velden en functies\".",
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
